  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Senegal Eau Potable &amp; Covid-19 (SEP &amp; COVID-19)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project aims to improve water supply in Senegal through increased access to secure and reliable potable water. In Saint-Louis, Kaolack and Kolda, the Project will increase production, storage and treatment capacity, and also extend the water network. In the three aforementioned secondary cities and nationwide, the Project aims to provide domestic water connections, including an important contribution to the national mechanism for subsidised water connections for households that meet specific social criteria.</narrative>
  </description>
